OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opens into death of
OL,4,Asoldier found in river
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest has opened into the death of
OL,7,Fa soldier who was found in the River
OL,8,FTyne after a night out.
OL,10,FNorthumbria Police recovered the body
OL,11,Fof Liam Potts, 22, who served with the
OL,12,FColdstream Guards, close to Wylam
OL,13,FBridge on 18 August.
OL,15,FPrior to his disappearance in the early
OL,16,Fhours of 15 August, the force said it
OL,17,Freceived reports of a disturbance at
OL,18,FThe Boathouse pub and a subsequent
OL,19,Fcollision at the bridge between a car
OL,20,Fand group of pedestrians.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
