OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opens into death of
OL,4,Asoldier found in river
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Northumberland Coroners' Court,
OL,7,Fassistant coroner Paul Dunn said the
OL,8,Fprovisional cause of death was
OL,9,Fcardio-respiratory arrest and the
OL,10,Finquest was adjourned until a future
OL,11,Fdate.
